{"id":"el-desaire-tmdb-1325798","type":"MOVIE","category":"CINE","title":"El desaire","overview":"Rosa fights to support her mother by selling flowers in Saltillo while pursuing her dream of studying law. However, her quest for independence turns into a nightmare when the suffocating jealousy of her boyfriend Juan and the obsessive harassment from Héctor, a dangerous customer, begin to close in on her. Based on the famous \"Corrido of Rosita Alvírez,\" The Disdain deconstructs everyday casual machismo in a powerful drama where a single \"no\" can escalate into a tragic fate.","releaseDate":"2026-09-03","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPf3iON6Y5a0QzKiVxjCiE16np5.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/nrXczIpRdgvQg1sGaBysEzwMzTe.jpg","genres":["Drama"],"originalLanguage":"es","spokenLanguages":["Spanish"],"images":[{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/nrXczIpRdgvQg1sGaBysEzwMzTe.jpg","label":"Escena 01"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/scR5xs50YeX8hTT2p2lXyuUIK2u.jpg","label":"Escena 02"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/6VUYqmCSLZQjF40MBVvaRGUYzk6.jpg","label":"Escena 03"}],"ratings":{},"availability":{},"cast":[{"name":"Vico Escorcia","role":"Rosa","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tdzmSPh2MmS0nT9AbgQTlkKHvpN.jpg","personTmdbId":1383932,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Joshua Okamoto","role":"Héctor","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0sfdrxVzZ6vWNjZFsotscaU8Et.jpg","personTmdbId":2412563,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Guillermo Alonso","role":"Juan","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lZ46Klc05hdquSfvzj8GN9qHtUq.jpg","personTmdbId":3315007,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Karen Martí","role":"Irma","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rygJHyHQHc0effF9jVS5cnOD7Wb.jpg","personTmdbId":2000340,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Gabriela de la Garza","role":"Ana","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8HEKAhZn4VtkvgiBLeYqYwc9dpP.jpg","personTmdbId":1492019,"department":"Acting"}],"crew":